不如無媾。秦雖善攻，不能取六縣；趙雖不能守，終不失六城。秦倦而歸，兵必罷。我以六城收天下以攻罷秦，是我失之於天下而取償於秦也。吾國尚利，孰與坐而割地，自弱以彊秦哉？今郝曰『秦善韓、魏而攻趙者，必以爲韓魏不救趙也而王之軍必孤有以王之事秦不如韓、魏也』，是使王歲以六城事秦也，即坐而城盡。來年秦復求割地，王將與之乎？弗與，是棄前功而挑秦禍也；與之，則無地而給之。語曰『彊者善攻，弱者不能守』。今坐而聽秦，秦兵不獘而多得地，是彊秦而弱趙也。以益彊之秦而割愈弱之趙，其計故不止矣。且王之地有盡而秦之求無已，以有盡之地而給無已之求，其勢必無趙矣。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"8ga_fba_dw9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"虞卿","kind":"person","person_id":"cdg_kvt_y0p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"虞卿","kind":"person","person_id":"cdg_kvt_y0p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"郝","kind":"person","person_id":"r01_ago_low","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"8ga_fba_dw9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"8ga_fba_dw9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"郝","kind":"person","person_id":"r01_ago_low","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0168","start":168,"end":169,"surface":"郝","kind":"person","person_id":"r01_ago_low","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0191","start":191,"end":192,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"8ga_fba_dw9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0198","start":198,"end":199,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"8ga_fba_dw9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-076-pingyu:m013-0212","start":212,"end":213,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"8ga_fba_dw9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id"